ely.\n5. For a new candidate, regenerate mechanically from the original input, list changed coordinates, and validate the final serialized payload immediately before submission.\n\n## Pitfalls\n\n- Do not conflate a validity error with a valid-but-incorrect prediction.\n- Do not explain away repeated incorrect feedback as a payload problem without checking the actual transmitted grid.\n- Do not keep re-deriving and submitting the same transformation after new examples merely reaffirm its local geometry; test feedback falsifies its application to that instance.\n- An analysis tool result that reports a Python syntax/serialization error is not validation. Fix the tool input or use a simple direct check before acting.", "file_type": ".md", "_source_path": "/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/H-hermes-luna6-high-rnd0/frozen/seen/play/users/u036/system/state/hermes/skills/reasoning/continual-arc-demo-discipline/references/rejected-resubmission-audit.md"}", "timestamp": 1792641451.866578, "tool_name": "skill_view", "tool_call_id": "call_QEQSferKDRVxY7ICgHyXuZND"}, {"id": 9947, "role": "assistant", "content": "{"action":"request_demos"}", "timestamp": 1792641468.5915318}, {"id": 9948, "role": "user", "content": "Feedback since your last action:
